{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11644","headline":"诸将五首 一 · 杜甫","name":"诸将五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉朝陵暮对南山，胡虏千秋尚入关。\n昨日玉鱼蒙葬地，早时今盌出人间。\n见愁汗马西戎逼，曾闪朱旗北斗殷。\n多少材官守泾渭，将军且莫破愁颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}